<urn:atm:triage:finding/AL6-WINCI-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AL6-WINCI-002" ;
  triage:title "storage_and_nudge_router.rs test imports unused on non-unix targets" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/storage_and_nudge_router.rs lines 277-281 import ResponseEnvelope, SendResponseEnvelope, ApiRequest in the test module, but they are used only inside test fn uds_runtime_reaches_the_canonical_storage_and_received_hook_path (around line 821), which is #[cfg(unix)]-gated. On Windows those 3 imports are therefore unused, causing a clippy::unused_imports failure. Gate the 3 imports (or the whole import block) behind #[cfg(unix)] alongside the test fn that uses them." ;
